# Fretboard Project — MPLAB Extensions for VS Code

## Build System

This is an **MPLAB Extensions for VS Code** project. The build configuration and file set are maintained in:

```
firmware/fretboard/.vscode/fretboard.mplab.json
```

When adding or removing source files, update the `fileSets[0].files` array in that JSON file. **Do not** create or modify `user.cmake` — the MPLAB extension regenerates the CMake files from `fretboard.mplab.json`.

## Project Layout

- `firmware/fretboard/` — Application source (main.c, app modules)
- `firmware/fretboard/fretboard-mcc/` — MCC/Harmony generated low-level code (do not edit; ignore `fretboard-mcc/src/main.c`)
- `firmware/fretboard/.vscode/fretboard.mplab.json` — Project config, toolchain, file set
- Peripheral PLIB headers and sources live under `fretboard-mcc/src/config/default/peripheral/`

## Target

- Device: PIC32CM6408PL10048 (Cortex-M0+)
- Toolchain: XC32
- Clock: 24 MHz
